"""The manifest every tool reads: the FerroTERM console's screens grouped as
the contact sheet shows them, each a resting screen followed by its
interactive states. (number, slug, title, route, caption); the slug is the
page's file name. The structure is the approved information architecture:
Dashboard; Terminology (code systems, value sets, concept maps, each with
its editor and history, and the concept browser); one Operations
workbench; and the Console group. The proposed screens are a group of
their own, unreachable from the live pages."""

